notes: "This is the identity problem. If I tell an agent to change page four, and the order has changed since the last version, page four is a different page. So every page has a stable Slide ID — the four-character code — separate from its Position. In these real status bars the same page, TPCJ, moved from position 4 of 22 to position 5 of 23 when a Section divider was inserted. The ID stayed TPCJ. That means I can ask for TPCJ, and the history belongs to TPCJ no matter where it sits."
